{
  "description": "Deterministic 'Herbs & Spices' rules for Romanian receipt and Open Food Facts names. A keyword must start a word; accents and case are ignored. A product moves only when a name hits an include keyword, no name hits an exclude keyword, and its category is listed in from_categories (or empty). Manually set categories are never changed.",
